---
import '@fontsource-variable/inter';
import '@fontsource-variable/manrope';
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Privacy | HDFC Bank Student Project</title>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap" style="max-width:800px; padding-block:48px; line-height:1.7">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">Back to home</a>
    <h1 style="font-size:2rem; margin-block:20px">Privacy notice</h1>
    <p>This independent student project uses fictional accounts and virtual funds.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem; margin-block:18px 6px">Information stored</h2>
    <p>We store your name, email address, account details and transaction history to operate your account. If you use a password, it is stored as a hash. If you sign in with Google, we use the verified account identity and email to authenticate you.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem; margin-block:18px 6px">Service providers</h2>
    <p>Render hosts the application, Aiven hosts the database, and Google provides optional sign-in. These providers process information needed to deliver their services.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem; margin-block:18px 6px">Storage and contact</h2>
    <p>The browser stores a temporary session token and may store a pending transaction request to prevent duplicate submissions. Contact the project maintainer at vaibhavsh0120@gmail.com for questions or account deletion requests.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
